                                          ule (optional). The format is <name>:<
                                          wrapper>. The module name must corresp
                                          ond with a module specified using --mo
                                          dule. The wrapper must contain %s as t
                                          he code placeholder
 --output_manifest VAL                  : Prints out a list of all the files in 
